  _description: 'Effect: Cutting Flurry''s third strike also attacks a second enemy
    adjacent to the original target. Each strike''s Hit Chance is reduced from 90%
    to 85%. The attack sequence still ends if a strike misses, and the third strike
    retains its +20 percentage-point Critical Chance bonus.


    Explanation: Allows
    Nikita to damage multiple enemies instead of focusing entirely on one target.
    Useful against bosses that summon additional enemies, but sacrifices individual
    attack reliability for greater offensive coverage. '
